<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.recovery.gathers ~ the recovery-contact group, and the verb each line names

`lares persona recovery-contact` gathers the four verbs of a face's recovery contacts: `offer` (a contact mints its fresh key for one face and prints its card and offer line), `show` (a face's prefix and its set), `enrol` (the face enrols its first set at a threshold, by one event its own key signs) and `view` (a contact signs its own view with its card). Bare, the group names no verb and refuses with this account, exit 2; an unknown word refuses the same way, naming it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ names the verbs and refuses; nothing moves`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.recovery.shows]] ~ the group names no verb, or one it does not answer; each of offer · show · enrol · view holds its own carrier`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/2 ~ the account of the four verbs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

